      "readme": "\nThe BUCNI EnvSounds 1back is a dataset collected using the EnvSounds dataset as stimuli: envisounds.org\n\nParticipants were instructed to press a button with their right index finger when a sound from the same category was heard twice in a row.\n\nThree participants performed 8 sessions of 7 runs, totalling approximately 4.7 hours of 1-back task performed using 10 sound categories.\n",
